{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41177","headline":"送舍利宿定普岩 · 孔德绍","name":"送舍利宿定普岩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仁祠表虚旷，祗园展肃恭。\n栖息翠微岭，登顿白云峰。\n映流看夜月，临峰听晓钟。\n涧芳十步草，崖阴百丈松。\n萧然遥路绝，无复市朝踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孔德绍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}